{"id":"19e900cf5d51a21c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/544_多模态逻辑_K_n.md","title":"544 多模态逻辑 K n","display":"544_多模态逻辑_K_n","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad n&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad n&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{544}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{544}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}_i\\ (i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}_i\\ (i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号和非原始缩写为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n[i]A=\\operatorname{box}_i(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n[i]A=\\operatorname{box}_i(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle i\\rangle A:=\\neg[i]\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle i\\rangle A:=\\neg[i]\\neg A,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{544}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{544}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}\">\\(i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}_i(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}_i(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与结构等价\">3. 自由变元与结构等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{544})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{544})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{box}_i(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(\\operatorname{box}_i(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。本语言无绑定构造子，并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{544}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{544}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{544}^{n}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{544}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{544}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{544}^{n}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,544}^{n}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,544}^{n}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{544}^{n}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{544}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{544})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{544}^{n}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{544}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{544})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{544}^{n}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{544}^{n}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}_i(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}_i(\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}_i(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}_i(\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n}(\\sigma,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<p>命题公理族定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{544,n}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{544,n}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}\">\\(i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>，定义正规分配公理族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,i}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{[i](A\\to B)\\to([i]A\\to[i]B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,i}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{[i](A\\to B)\\to([i]A\\to[i]B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{544}^{n}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}}\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,i}^{544,n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{544}^{n}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}}\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,i}^{544,n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}\">\\(i\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,i}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{((A),[i]A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,i}^{544,n}\n=\n\\{((A),[i]A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示形式与载体类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{[i]A}\\ (Nec_i),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{[i]A}\\ (Nec_i),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n}\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n})^2\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,i}^{544,n}\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n})^1\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n}\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n})^2\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,i}^{544,n}\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n})^1\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{544}^{n}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,i}^{544,n}\n\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{544}^{n}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,i}^{544,n}\n\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{544}^{n}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{544}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}\\)</span>，并且每行是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>假设行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>公理行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{544}^{n}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{544}^{n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>MP 行，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 个必然化行，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}\">\\(r\\in\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,r}^{544,n}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,r}^{544,n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{544}^{n}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{544}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{544}^{n}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{544}^{n}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{544}^{n}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{544}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{544}^{n}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{544}^{n}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{544}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{544}^{n}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{544}^{n}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{544}^{n}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{544}^{n}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{544}^{n}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目把单一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个互不相同的原始模态构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}_i\">\\(\\operatorname{box}_i\\)</span>，并为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 定义独立的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_i\">\\(K_i\\)</span> 公理族和必然化规则；不同模态之间没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"4\">\\(4\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"5\">\\(5\\)</span> 或交互公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_n^{544}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\n\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{544},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{544}^{n},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{544}^{n},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,i}^{544,n})_{i&lt;n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{544}^{n},\n\\vdash_{544}^{n}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K_n^{544}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\n\\mathsf{Mode}_{544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{544},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{544}^{n},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{544}^{n},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{544}^{n},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{544}^{n},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{544,n},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,i}^{544,n})_{i&lt;n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{544}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{544}^{n},\n\\vdash_{544}^{n}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含多模态句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含多关系框架、赋值、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":